# The ShredPace research: reference material about another product, kept on the Owner's
# machine and no longer tracked here (D-040, intent/process/9003-untrack-shredpace/).
# It remains recoverable from any commit up to that change; history was not rewritten.
# This replaces the narrower evidence/ rule, which this one subsumes.
#
# The contents are excluded rather than the directory itself: git cannot re-include a file
# beneath an excluded DIRECTORY, so the trailing-slash form would make the README below
# impossible to track.
docs/product/shredpace/*
!docs/product/shredpace/README.md

# Git worktrees created by Claude Code sessions. Each is a full checkout; never commit one.
.claude/worktrees/

# Node dependencies for the design tools (docs/design/ailiftcoach/tools/).
node_modules/

# The test runner's scratch output (.vitest/json/output.json); never commit it.
.vitest/

# CDK synth output (infra/). Never commit it: it holds the bundled Lambda code.
cdk.out/
